<div class="mandarin-hanzi">读</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">dú</div>

''Meaning:'' read; study  
''Part of speech:'' verb

!! In context
她每天读一本书。 — Tā měitiān dú yì běn shū. — She reads a book every day.

!! Usage note
Means 'read' or, in contexts such as 读书 (dúshū), 'study'. Reading aloud can be expressed more specifically with 朗读 (lǎngdú); 读 itself does not necessarily mean reading aloud.
